WEBVTT

00:12.000 --> 00:14.560
♪Trapped in this tiny world♪

00:15.040 --> 00:18.440
♪I'm crushed into dust♪

00:19.200 --> 00:23.000
♪I meddle around without any mercy♪

00:23.320 --> 00:26.160
♪I'm my own pawn♪

00:26.520 --> 00:30.360
♪I sigh at my fate♪

00:30.560 --> 00:35.360
♪Numerous people are under my control♪

00:38.040 --> 00:41.880
♪All the sand is washed away♪

00:44.280 --> 00:47.880
♪An old dream fades♪

00:50.200 --> 00:54.560
♪A bumpy path lies ahead♪

00:56.040 --> 00:58.880
♪Traps within traps, I never make mistakes♪

00:59.200 --> 01:02.000
♪I take a risk at every step♪

01:02.280 --> 01:07.400
♪Even in disputes, I break through with my life♪

01:07.880 --> 01:10.280
♪Schemes within schemes, I prison myself♪

01:10.520 --> 01:13.600
♪Each link swaps bluff and truth♪

01:13.920 --> 01:16.480
♪The world is my Weiqi game board♪

01:16.800 --> 01:22.120
♪Everything's just fleeting♪

01:23.720 --> 01:28.320
♪The play begins♪

01:30.280 --> 01:32.520
♪No return is expected♪

01:32.880 --> 01:37.880
♪The flame is gone, whether we win or lose♪

01:38.280 --> 01:40.360
♪The wind never ceases. I hold the reins♪

01:40.360 --> 01:41.510
[Ashes To Crown]

01:41.510 --> 01:45.680
[Adapted from Xixing's novel, Empress of the State of Chu]

01:46.470 --> 01:49.000
[Episode 21]

01:50.020 --> 01:52.340
Zhu Yong is backed by the Grand Princess.

01:52.580 --> 01:54.380
Now, in the Imperial Guard Office,

01:54.460 --> 01:55.100
he's a favorite.

01:55.540 --> 01:57.500
The Imperial Guard Office arrests anyone at will.

01:57.660 --> 01:58.700
Even Mr. Deng...

02:04.460 --> 02:06.660
His Majesty is here.

02:23.940 --> 02:25.100
Kneel.

02:29.460 --> 02:31.380
- Greetings, Your Majesty. - Greetings, Your Majesty.

02:31.580 --> 02:33.700
- Greetings, Your Highness. - Greetings, Your Highness.

02:34.260 --> 02:35.420
Bow.

02:38.940 --> 02:40.020
You may rise.

02:40.460 --> 02:42.300
- Thank you, Your Majesty. - Thank you, Your Majesty.

02:46.620 --> 02:47.300
Your Highness,

02:47.980 --> 02:49.340
I request to go to Huzhou

02:49.660 --> 02:51.340
for the summer flood corruption case.

02:55.780 --> 02:57.260
This is a serious case.

02:57.820 --> 02:58.860
The Commandant of Justice,

02:59.260 --> 03:00.100
the Minister of Revenue,

03:00.500 --> 03:02.140
and the Imperial Guard Office will co-investigate.

03:03.020 --> 03:04.380
Mr. Deng, make the arrangements.

03:08.100 --> 03:08.660
Yes.

03:14.380 --> 03:15.860
Her Highness had the Imperial Guard Office

03:15.860 --> 03:16.860
cooperate with Mr. Deng

03:17.100 --> 03:17.980
[Xie Residence]
instead of being arbitrary.

03:18.580 --> 03:19.660
And Mr. Deng responded

03:19.660 --> 03:20.540
to Her Highness.

03:21.340 --> 03:22.540
Doesn't that mean

03:23.300 --> 03:25.300
he accepts her political interference?

03:28.300 --> 03:29.540
How do I know what she thinks?

03:32.340 --> 03:33.780
Don't you always say

03:33.980 --> 03:35.420
Chu Zhao is just like you?

03:36.420 --> 03:37.340
How do you not know

03:37.940 --> 03:38.900
what she thinks?

03:41.620 --> 03:42.180
Fine.

03:43.780 --> 03:44.700
Then I will

03:45.220 --> 03:46.340
think about it.

03:52.540 --> 03:54.580
Last night, she visited Mr. Deng.

03:55.820 --> 03:56.700
I thought

03:57.180 --> 03:59.540
they would fall out and break up.

04:02.780 --> 04:03.740
Unexpectedly,

04:05.100 --> 04:06.340
they put on an act together.

04:07.300 --> 04:08.380
An act?

04:09.180 --> 04:09.940
For whom?

04:10.460 --> 04:11.540
Me, of course.

04:12.820 --> 04:14.380
In case my clan has sole dominance

04:14.940 --> 04:16.380
and seizes power from His Majesty,

04:17.420 --> 04:18.820
she even supports Mr. Deng

04:19.260 --> 04:21.300
to maintain tripartite balance within the court.

04:22.540 --> 04:23.460
She's clever.

04:25.300 --> 04:26.700
But sadly, she's too soft-hearted.

04:27.500 --> 04:28.940
She wants a stable court.

04:29.500 --> 04:30.940
Then I will let her know

04:32.140 --> 04:34.380
kindness can't survive in this world.

05:04.940 --> 05:06.900
Have Yu Shang send this to the Northern Desert.

05:07.380 --> 05:09.140
It's been years since Zhong Changrong

05:09.620 --> 05:11.300
guarded Xinggu Pass.

05:12.260 --> 05:14.140
He should rest.

05:14.860 --> 05:16.380
If Xinggu Pass is invaded...

05:16.380 --> 05:16.980
So...

05:17.700 --> 05:19.660
We'll have Liang Qiang prepare early.

05:34.260 --> 05:36.260
Greetings, Your Majesty.

05:37.180 --> 05:38.340
You're back, Qi Bo.

05:38.620 --> 05:39.740
You're just in time.

05:40.060 --> 05:41.780
The provisions you brought back last time

05:41.860 --> 05:42.820
are running out.

05:43.060 --> 05:44.140
Go get some more.

05:44.700 --> 05:45.380
Already?

05:46.020 --> 05:48.060
We have three contingents.

05:48.420 --> 05:50.060
They're certainly consumed quickly.

05:50.820 --> 05:51.500
Three?

05:52.500 --> 05:54.180
The Eldest Prince is in the rear,

05:55.180 --> 05:57.500
but he still needs our provisions.

05:57.700 --> 05:59.500
My son is securing the rear.

06:00.500 --> 06:02.340
He must be well-fed.

06:06.420 --> 06:07.340
Don't worry.

06:08.300 --> 06:09.220
I'll get the provisions

06:09.260 --> 06:11.100
as soon as I can.

06:13.180 --> 06:14.540
This time,

06:15.380 --> 06:16.220
I've brought you

06:16.740 --> 06:17.740
a transaction

06:18.700 --> 06:20.660
that is very beneficial.

06:34.180 --> 06:34.900
Interesting.

06:35.460 --> 06:36.740
How interesting.

06:38.500 --> 06:39.700
Xie Yanfang

06:40.260 --> 06:43.460
wants me to kill Zhong Changrong

06:43.860 --> 06:45.420
at Xinggu Pass.

06:47.100 --> 06:50.340
Xiao Xun wants my army

06:50.580 --> 06:52.460
to pass Xiaonan.

06:54.460 --> 06:55.900
These two idiots

06:56.740 --> 06:58.660
both want to court me.

06:59.220 --> 06:59.860
All right.

07:00.420 --> 07:02.660
Then I will fulfill

07:02.660 --> 07:04.020
their wishes.

07:04.420 --> 07:05.300
Your Majesty is wise.

07:05.860 --> 07:06.900
Chu Ling is dead.

07:07.140 --> 07:08.460
The State of Chu has civil strife.

07:08.940 --> 07:11.300
This is exactly our moment.

07:13.340 --> 07:14.180
Issue my order.

07:14.780 --> 07:15.940
Send a troop of soldiers.

07:16.900 --> 07:18.660
I'll show them

07:20.420 --> 07:22.540
how I can benefit

07:26.780 --> 07:28.260
from their own infighting.

07:28.940 --> 07:31.700
[Xinggu Pass]

07:47.420 --> 07:49.020
Don't move, General Liang.

07:51.980 --> 07:52.820
What do you want?

07:53.380 --> 07:54.220
Don't be nervous.

07:55.260 --> 07:57.340
The Northern Desert troops are just passing by.

08:00.460 --> 08:01.580
This is treason!

08:02.460 --> 08:04.100
It isn't.

08:04.660 --> 08:06.900
It's just a deal.

08:08.020 --> 08:09.380
Mr. Xie passed an order.

08:09.820 --> 08:11.380
"Their troops need a victory.

08:12.620 --> 08:14.180
And the victory we give them

08:14.660 --> 08:15.580
will have no impact

08:15.620 --> 08:16.500
on our war situation."

08:17.420 --> 08:18.260
Does Mr. Xie know

08:19.580 --> 08:20.980
what will happen?

08:21.380 --> 08:22.380
He said

08:22.780 --> 08:25.060
the Northern Desert King would send troops.

08:26.220 --> 08:27.300
Zhong Changrong

08:27.540 --> 08:29.220
would die at Xinggu Pass.

08:29.460 --> 08:29.820
Then...

08:30.380 --> 08:31.420
His position

08:32.380 --> 08:33.220
will be yours.

08:34.380 --> 08:35.180
General Liang,

08:35.540 --> 08:36.700
all you need to do

08:36.700 --> 08:37.460
is stand here

08:37.900 --> 08:38.660
and pretend

08:38.780 --> 08:40.260
you didn't see anything.

09:04.860 --> 09:06.860
[Xinggu Pass]

09:06.900 --> 09:08.140
[Changping Pass]

09:08.400 --> 09:12.200
[Changping Pass]

09:18.980 --> 09:19.380
General,

09:20.260 --> 09:21.420
the enemy king decamped

09:21.580 --> 09:22.260
and disappeared.

09:23.420 --> 09:24.740
So far,

09:25.500 --> 09:27.020
no beacon smoke has been seen

09:27.020 --> 09:28.820
throughout Yunzhong.

09:30.340 --> 09:30.860
Could they be

09:30.900 --> 09:31.780
lying in ambush?

09:34.860 --> 09:36.620
From their former encampment

09:37.300 --> 09:38.180
to Yunzhong,

09:39.180 --> 09:40.580
there aren't valleys or depressions

09:40.580 --> 09:41.500
for such a large army

09:42.540 --> 09:43.260
to hide.

09:43.580 --> 09:44.660
Report!

09:46.180 --> 09:47.420
Raid on Xinggu Pass!

09:51.260 --> 09:52.660
Zhong is just patrolling there.

09:53.260 --> 09:53.580
But...

09:54.140 --> 09:55.540
General Zhong's route

09:55.620 --> 09:56.740
is a military secret.

09:57.420 --> 09:58.260
Call up 500 soldiers.

09:58.540 --> 09:59.020
We'll go.

09:59.300 --> 09:59.660
Yes.

10:04.180 --> 10:04.780
General,

10:04.940 --> 10:06.020
this raid is so precise.

10:06.140 --> 10:07.500
Someone must have leaked our route.

10:07.700 --> 10:08.660
Do they think they can

10:08.660 --> 10:09.620
invade us this way?

10:09.700 --> 10:10.620
What a pipe dream!

10:11.780 --> 10:14.180
I'm their target.

10:36.980 --> 10:37.540
General Liang,

10:38.100 --> 10:39.500
the Northern Desert troops passed

10:39.540 --> 10:40.620
through your guarding area.

10:41.140 --> 10:42.060
However perfectly

10:42.100 --> 10:43.340
we carry out this plan,

10:43.540 --> 10:44.220
Zhong Changrong

10:44.380 --> 10:45.860
will suspect you.

10:46.860 --> 10:48.060
When he gets to the bottom,

10:48.540 --> 10:49.300
by then,

10:49.940 --> 10:51.500
even if someone protects you,

10:51.820 --> 10:53.340
you'll have to work in the labor camp

10:53.460 --> 10:54.820
as a guilty person.

10:55.180 --> 10:56.300
Your clan

10:56.700 --> 10:58.340
won't be able to rise again.

11:13.300 --> 11:13.980
So,

11:15.420 --> 11:16.540
what do you want me to do?

11:17.540 --> 11:18.940
You have to kill

11:18.940 --> 11:19.700
all those enemies.

11:19.940 --> 11:20.420
Because

11:20.700 --> 11:21.980
Zhong Changrong's followers

11:22.180 --> 11:23.340
must witness that scene

11:23.620 --> 11:24.540
of valor and tragedy.

11:24.980 --> 11:25.500
Right now,

11:25.700 --> 11:27.020
a squad of several hundred men

11:27.180 --> 11:28.380
is patrolling not far away.

11:30.660 --> 11:32.020
Shoot this whistling arrow.

11:32.260 --> 11:33.580
Our men will lure that squad

11:33.620 --> 11:34.580
over to you.

11:34.900 --> 11:35.380
That way,

11:36.060 --> 11:37.540
your bravery will be witnessed.

11:38.060 --> 11:38.980
And you won't die

11:39.180 --> 11:40.300
while outnumbered.

11:41.860 --> 11:42.500
General Liang,

11:43.100 --> 11:44.740
after you take over

11:44.980 --> 11:46.220
the frontier command,

11:46.460 --> 11:47.940
you'll bring glory to the state

11:47.980 --> 11:48.740
and fortune to people.

11:49.500 --> 11:50.580
Your name will

11:51.500 --> 11:52.500
go down in history.

11:58.100 --> 12:00.700
Charge!

12:04.620 --> 12:06.020
You should be guarding Xinggu Pass.

12:06.060 --> 12:06.860
Why are you here?

12:07.300 --> 12:08.660
I was surveying nearby terrain

12:09.100 --> 12:09.860
and passed by.

12:10.860 --> 12:11.660
Another squad

12:11.660 --> 12:12.340
is coming over.

12:12.540 --> 12:13.540
Hold on, General Zhong.

13:18.740 --> 13:19.980
Take him back! Keep him alive!

13:20.380 --> 13:20.940
- Yes. - Yes.

13:20.940 --> 13:21.500
Mr. Zhong.

13:24.660 --> 13:25.220
Hurry.

13:25.780 --> 13:27.860
Send men to defend Xinggu Pass.

13:28.660 --> 13:29.100
Mr. Zhong.

13:29.620 --> 13:30.100
Mr. Zhong.

13:31.140 --> 13:32.020
Light a smoke signal.

13:32.380 --> 13:33.220
Full-scale alert!

13:33.660 --> 13:34.140
Yes.

13:34.140 --> 13:36.420
[Xinggu Pass]

13:45.140 --> 13:46.060
How's General?

13:47.260 --> 13:48.500
His vital organs aren't injured.

13:49.020 --> 13:50.420
But he's bleeding seriously.

13:50.940 --> 13:51.860
I'm afraid...

13:53.740 --> 13:54.660
Keep him alive.

13:54.660 --> 13:55.460
Or I'll kill you.

13:55.900 --> 13:56.300
Yes.

13:56.500 --> 13:57.700
I'll do my best.

13:57.700 --> 13:58.300
General.

13:59.060 --> 13:59.460
General.

14:00.060 --> 14:01.180
Wangcheng is lost.

14:05.660 --> 14:06.220
It's a trap.

14:35.740 --> 14:36.980
Did you have a nightmare?

14:38.420 --> 14:39.460
Shall I take you back

14:39.460 --> 14:40.260
for some rest?

14:46.220 --> 14:46.700
Your Highness,

14:47.060 --> 14:47.980
urgent frontier report.

14:48.100 --> 14:48.820
Wangcheng is lost.

14:48.980 --> 14:49.940
General Zhong is badly injured.

15:02.420 --> 15:03.140
How is Jiu doing?

15:03.580 --> 15:04.860
We don't know the specifics.

15:08.740 --> 15:09.660
Don't worry too much.

15:10.180 --> 15:10.940
When Jiu is there,

15:11.540 --> 15:12.700
the frontier won't fall.

15:20.780 --> 15:21.820
The report only says

15:21.820 --> 15:23.460
enemy troops broke through Xinggu Pass.

15:24.140 --> 15:24.700
Not a word

15:24.700 --> 15:25.740
is about Liang Qiang.

15:26.340 --> 15:27.420
He's the general

15:27.420 --> 15:28.340
guarding Xinggu Pass.

15:28.620 --> 15:29.780
In such a big case,

15:30.420 --> 15:32.060
his condition should be reported,

15:32.460 --> 15:33.700
whether he's dead or missing.

15:35.340 --> 15:36.100
Unless

15:37.660 --> 15:39.140
he's highly suspicious

15:39.780 --> 15:40.980
and many people are involved.

15:41.940 --> 15:43.020
So, at this crucial point,

15:43.020 --> 15:43.940
it must be set aside

15:44.740 --> 15:45.860
to avoid shaking the morale.

15:51.260 --> 15:53.100
Wangcheng is strategically vital!

15:53.660 --> 15:54.780
Once it's lost,

15:55.140 --> 15:56.580
Yunzhong will be in peril!

15:57.100 --> 15:59.900
If Yunzhong is lost,

16:00.380 --> 16:01.860
our state will be in peril!

16:02.460 --> 16:03.320
That's right.

16:08.580 --> 16:10.260
Xie Yanlai bragged that he would

16:10.760 --> 16:12.060
kill the Northern Desert King.

16:12.540 --> 16:14.580
But now, he can't even defend the frontier.

16:15.260 --> 16:16.460
He must be severely punished.

16:16.980 --> 16:17.900
Right!

16:18.180 --> 16:19.720
He lost one city.

16:19.720 --> 16:21.400
Then he may lose another.

16:21.480 --> 16:24.060
How many cities are there

16:24.740 --> 16:26.060
at the frontier?

16:26.300 --> 16:28.140
How could Your Highness trust

16:28.380 --> 16:30.460
such an impetuous man?

16:31.140 --> 16:33.140
Things can't go on like this.

16:34.660 --> 16:35.260
Ministers,

16:36.540 --> 16:37.460
at this point,

16:37.460 --> 16:39.220
what's the use of arguing?

16:42.220 --> 16:44.260
The Northern Desert King sent a message,

16:45.380 --> 16:46.740
asking for peace talks.

16:47.180 --> 16:48.140
I think

16:48.860 --> 16:50.420
we should avoid direct confrontation.

16:51.900 --> 16:52.860
We will

16:55.060 --> 16:56.420
never accept peace talks.

17:08.700 --> 17:09.460
Never?

17:11.740 --> 17:13.060
So will the war continue?

17:14.420 --> 17:16.340
Will we ignore the people in Wangcheng?

17:16.740 --> 17:18.500
The King wants friendly relations

17:19.020 --> 17:20.180
and territorial concessions.

17:21.380 --> 17:22.340
Is this a peace offer?

17:22.780 --> 17:23.980
This is a humiliation.

17:25.100 --> 17:26.540
Countless soldiers shouldn't

17:26.540 --> 17:27.220
die in vain.

17:27.820 --> 17:29.180
My father's decade-long persistence

17:29.180 --> 17:30.020
shouldn't be wasted.

17:30.340 --> 17:31.620
Wangcheng is lost,

17:32.260 --> 17:33.380
but Your Highness is still so stubborn.

17:33.940 --> 17:35.580
What will people think of you?

17:37.180 --> 17:38.660
Why don't you leave the court

17:40.020 --> 17:41.940
and let me handle this?

17:42.460 --> 17:43.940
Mr. Deng, are you saying

17:44.580 --> 17:45.860
I am to blame for the error

17:46.100 --> 17:47.260
of the frontier troops?

17:48.540 --> 17:49.780
Xie Yanlai serves you.

17:50.980 --> 17:51.820
In that case,

17:51.820 --> 17:53.420
you can't shirk the blame.

17:54.340 --> 17:56.140
When I was in charge, the frontier was safe.

17:57.180 --> 17:58.940
After the supervisors you sent there,

17:59.660 --> 18:01.540
especially Liang Qiang you favor,

18:02.060 --> 18:03.340
failed their duties,

18:03.660 --> 18:05.180
the enemies managed to break in.

18:08.860 --> 18:09.540
Your Highness

18:09.540 --> 18:10.740
learned to shift blame.

18:12.060 --> 18:12.940
I would rather say,

18:13.500 --> 18:14.820
I interfered

18:14.820 --> 18:15.900
so late

18:16.100 --> 18:17.940
that frontier troops were too corrupt

18:17.940 --> 18:18.900
to be mended.

18:18.980 --> 18:20.380
Even when Liang Qiang was favored,

18:21.860 --> 18:23.860
he couldn't reverse the decline!

18:24.900 --> 18:25.980
Mr. Deng,

18:27.220 --> 18:28.700
who do you think will benefit

18:29.540 --> 18:30.980
from the failure of frontier troops

18:31.580 --> 18:32.740
and the loss of a city?

18:38.300 --> 18:39.700
You don't think

18:40.820 --> 18:42.220
I used the failure of the troops

18:42.220 --> 18:43.580
and the suffering of the people

18:44.540 --> 18:45.340
to force you

18:45.340 --> 18:47.380
out of the court, do you?

18:48.620 --> 18:49.460
Chu Zhao,

18:50.460 --> 18:51.380
you aren't worthy.

18:52.380 --> 18:53.620
You always claim

18:53.620 --> 18:54.780
you prioritize self-interest.

18:55.140 --> 18:56.260
I thought you were

18:56.260 --> 18:57.300
just saying that for fun.

18:57.700 --> 18:58.500
What a surprise.

18:59.460 --> 19:00.940
You really dared to do that.

19:02.060 --> 19:02.580
Xiaoman.

19:14.020 --> 19:15.220
These are your letters

19:15.220 --> 19:16.100
with frontier troops,

19:16.220 --> 19:17.780
including private letters.

19:22.100 --> 19:22.740
Chu Zhao,

19:23.340 --> 19:25.860
how dare you pry into my privacy?

19:26.020 --> 19:27.500
I just did, so what?

19:27.940 --> 19:29.540
You supervise by late Emperor's order.

19:29.900 --> 19:31.540
I protect the state by his order.

19:32.420 --> 19:33.660
So, I must know

19:33.660 --> 19:34.620
anything that involves

19:35.180 --> 19:36.300
our state affairs.

19:37.980 --> 19:39.300
Take out Mr. Deng's letters

19:39.300 --> 19:39.860
to and from Liang Qiang.

19:40.940 --> 19:42.420
And his letters with other ministers

19:42.580 --> 19:44.300
where they plotted

19:44.300 --> 19:44.780
to depose me.

19:44.780 --> 19:45.180
Yes.

19:53.420 --> 19:54.460
Liang Qiang said

19:55.220 --> 19:57.020
his transfer to Xinggu Pass was improper.

19:58.660 --> 19:59.580
You said

20:00.500 --> 20:02.140
he could just go ahead

20:02.500 --> 20:03.820
and you would take responsibility

20:04.140 --> 20:05.420
if anything went wrong.

20:07.340 --> 20:08.420
Liang Qiang did write me

20:08.420 --> 20:09.260
this letter.

20:10.340 --> 20:11.900
Then I replied like that.

20:12.340 --> 20:13.060
What's wrong?

20:13.260 --> 20:15.740
A frontier general knew it was improper.

20:17.380 --> 20:19.500
And a civil official like you far back in the Capital

20:20.420 --> 20:21.900
insisted on meddling

20:22.220 --> 20:23.340
in military affairs.

20:27.340 --> 20:28.140
So?

20:29.420 --> 20:30.140
So,

20:30.500 --> 20:32.180
you won't come to the court for a while.

20:33.060 --> 20:34.900
Go back home and reflect on yourself.

20:43.940 --> 20:44.900
Good.

20:47.020 --> 20:47.660
Very good.

20:49.700 --> 20:51.180
Let me see

20:51.180 --> 20:52.380
if you can get what you desire

20:53.740 --> 20:55.980
when I'm away from the court.

20:56.980 --> 20:57.620
Xiaoman,

20:58.260 --> 20:59.700
send him back home.

21:00.060 --> 21:01.140
Yes, Your Highness.

21:27.820 --> 21:28.500
Mr. Deng,

21:30.060 --> 21:30.980
how have you been?

21:33.420 --> 21:35.180
Mr. Xie, to what do I

21:35.740 --> 21:36.860
owe this pleasure?

21:38.020 --> 21:39.700
I'm here to apologize.

21:41.900 --> 21:43.300
You took the blame

21:44.620 --> 21:46.300
for the loss of Wangcheng.

21:47.420 --> 21:48.340
I sent the message

21:48.340 --> 21:49.420
to the Northern Desert.

21:50.100 --> 21:51.140
And I asked Liang Qiang

21:52.140 --> 21:53.500
to defect.

21:54.180 --> 21:56.180
As for why the enemies passed through Xiaonan

21:56.580 --> 21:57.740
to attack Wangcheng...

21:59.500 --> 22:00.260
I need not say,

22:01.780 --> 22:03.860
for you know who did that.

22:04.380 --> 22:05.220
Xie Yanfang!

22:08.220 --> 22:09.420
How could you do this

22:09.700 --> 22:11.180
to frontier troops and civilians

22:11.180 --> 22:11.860
at Wangcheng?

22:12.460 --> 22:14.580
They are people of our state.

22:15.500 --> 22:16.780
They'll die a worthy death

22:19.780 --> 22:21.220
to sacrifice for their state.

22:22.700 --> 22:24.100
You can go and turn me in.

22:25.060 --> 22:25.780
However,

22:26.900 --> 22:27.900
who would believe

22:27.900 --> 22:28.980
your one-sided statement?

22:43.780 --> 22:44.380
Fine.

22:46.540 --> 22:47.780
I'll wait and see

22:48.500 --> 22:49.140
what exactly

22:50.140 --> 22:51.700
you are up to.

22:56.180 --> 22:57.580
Well, it's getting late.

22:59.820 --> 23:00.860
I'll take my leave.

23:10.100 --> 23:11.620
I do hope

23:12.820 --> 23:14.220
I can see you again

23:15.060 --> 23:16.580
at the court.

23:52.500 --> 23:53.820
Thinking about what happened?

23:59.460 --> 24:00.820
Be seated, Mr. Xie.

24:04.900 --> 24:06.380
I thought hard, but I don't get it.

24:07.260 --> 24:08.140
If he simply wanted me

24:08.140 --> 24:09.260
to withdraw from the court,

24:09.820 --> 24:11.380
why did he sacrifice the frontier

24:11.780 --> 24:13.180
and civilians in Wangcheng?

24:13.820 --> 24:14.660
This isn't

24:14.660 --> 24:15.420
Deng Yi's style.

24:15.940 --> 24:16.460
Your Highness,

24:17.100 --> 24:18.060
Mr. Deng's desire

24:18.100 --> 24:19.580
has never changed.

24:20.060 --> 24:20.900
I have proof

24:21.300 --> 24:22.180
that Liang Qiang

24:22.180 --> 24:23.300
serves Mr. Deng.

24:24.580 --> 24:25.660
So you think he wants

24:26.740 --> 24:27.860
to command frontier troops?

24:32.940 --> 24:34.660
So, he wanted Mr. Zhong dead

24:35.180 --> 24:36.140
in this raid,

24:36.980 --> 24:38.500
then Liang Qiang would turn the tide

24:38.780 --> 24:39.580
and take command.

24:40.260 --> 24:41.140
To be honest,

24:42.340 --> 24:44.060
it has something to do with Yanlai.

24:45.420 --> 24:46.580
I guess Mr. Deng believed

24:47.300 --> 24:48.660
Yanlai dared to make

24:48.660 --> 24:49.620
that military pledge

24:50.660 --> 24:51.740
because my whole clan

24:51.740 --> 24:52.980
backed him up.

24:54.300 --> 24:55.380
He couldn't bear to see

24:55.420 --> 24:56.220
military power slip.

24:56.940 --> 24:58.300
That's why he took desperate risks

24:58.740 --> 24:59.620
at any cost.

25:01.340 --> 25:02.140
As for Wangcheng...

25:04.060 --> 25:05.460
We are not certain

25:05.860 --> 25:06.900
if he was behind that.

25:08.020 --> 25:08.860
Or maybe

25:10.020 --> 25:11.140
that was merely an accident.

25:12.380 --> 25:14.140
After all, the tides of war always change.

25:14.540 --> 25:15.340
One false move

25:15.900 --> 25:17.060
may lead to the loss of a city.

25:21.300 --> 25:22.980
I don't usually get along with Mr. Deng.

25:23.940 --> 25:24.980
But I refuse to believe

25:25.740 --> 25:27.620
he would collude with our enemies.

25:29.260 --> 25:30.620
Now, the situation is complicated.

25:31.260 --> 25:32.020
For the moment,

25:32.900 --> 25:33.420
our priority

25:33.420 --> 25:35.100
is to stabilize the court.

25:39.660 --> 25:40.220
I know.

25:41.700 --> 25:42.500
He was placed

25:42.820 --> 25:43.860
under house arrest

25:44.020 --> 25:45.340
because he argued with me

25:45.380 --> 25:46.100
on whether to have

25:46.820 --> 25:47.620
peace talks.

25:48.900 --> 25:50.380
As for how we should handle him...

25:50.900 --> 25:52.020
After we take back Wangcheng

25:52.380 --> 25:53.540
and uncover the truth,

25:53.780 --> 25:54.500
we'll know.

25:55.420 --> 25:56.860
Don't worry too much.

25:57.580 --> 25:59.220
The sudden loss of Wangcheng

26:00.060 --> 26:01.220
was truly horrifying.

26:01.980 --> 26:02.940
Fortunately,

26:03.300 --> 26:04.660
Yunzhong led all units

26:04.900 --> 26:05.900
to heavily guard it

26:06.300 --> 26:08.020
and fought the invaders.

26:08.700 --> 26:09.740
Those invaders failed

26:09.940 --> 26:10.820
to advance further.

26:13.460 --> 26:15.020
I have faith in frontier troops.

26:16.180 --> 26:17.500
But how about people in Wangcheng?

26:19.260 --> 26:20.540
If we reject peace talks,

26:20.940 --> 26:23.100
the enemies will threaten us with a massacre.

26:25.060 --> 26:26.180
Peace talks

26:27.060 --> 26:28.020
start with talks.

26:28.620 --> 26:29.540
In that case,

26:30.300 --> 26:31.980
we'll have time to negotiate.

26:33.620 --> 26:34.460
Rest assured.

26:34.940 --> 26:35.700
Soon,

26:36.180 --> 26:37.060
I will ask

26:37.060 --> 26:37.980
relevant ministers

26:38.460 --> 26:39.620
to draft an agenda

26:40.260 --> 26:41.180
for you to review.

26:42.580 --> 26:43.580
Thank you, Mr. Xie.

26:45.180 --> 26:46.340
Mr. Deng has been confined.

26:46.940 --> 26:47.820
At this moment,

26:49.020 --> 26:50.100
I should step up.

26:51.180 --> 26:52.100
You're truly a blessing

26:52.580 --> 26:53.660
for our state.

26:58.300 --> 27:00.180
Don't say that, Your Highness.

27:03.340 --> 27:04.340
In every way,

27:05.900 --> 27:07.060
we're a family.

27:13.420 --> 27:14.540
Tea is good.

27:15.740 --> 27:17.100
But too much tea will upset you.

27:17.940 --> 27:19.220
It's almost lunchtime.

27:20.620 --> 27:22.020
Go have a good lunch with Yu

27:22.460 --> 27:23.420
and get some sleep.

27:24.140 --> 27:25.060
I'm afraid

27:25.060 --> 27:26.300
we're going to confront

27:26.980 --> 27:28.140
tough challenges.

27:29.380 --> 27:30.380
I certainly believe

27:30.940 --> 27:32.460
you're tough-minded enough.

27:32.900 --> 27:33.820
But,

27:34.300 --> 27:34.980
you still need

27:34.980 --> 27:36.300
a healthy body.

27:41.740 --> 27:42.580
Don't panic.

27:46.300 --> 27:47.100
You have me.

28:00.380 --> 28:00.860
Le.

28:02.620 --> 28:03.140
Your Highness.

28:03.460 --> 28:04.260
Recently,

28:04.940 --> 28:06.140
has Xiao Xun behaved?

28:06.540 --> 28:07.260
Precisely.

28:08.020 --> 28:08.940
For nearly half a year,

28:09.140 --> 28:10.340
he hasn't left his house.

28:10.780 --> 28:11.660
Over the last month,

28:11.660 --> 28:12.740
he has stayed indoors,

28:12.800 --> 28:14.060
making his father's birthday gift.

28:14.700 --> 28:15.380
Keep watching.

28:15.660 --> 28:16.100
Yes.

28:49.700 --> 28:50.140
Your Highness,

28:50.460 --> 28:51.220
news just came in.

28:51.740 --> 28:53.220
Mr. Deng was escorted out by the Imperial Guard Office

28:53.460 --> 28:54.340
and then confined in his mansion.

28:54.580 --> 28:55.540
The reason is unknown.

28:55.900 --> 28:56.820
We only know he fought

28:56.820 --> 28:57.900
Her Highness after court.

29:03.460 --> 29:04.020
Your Highness,

29:04.700 --> 29:05.860
this might be our chance.

29:06.420 --> 29:08.260
Before I finish my father's gift,

29:09.940 --> 29:10.580
so much

29:10.580 --> 29:12.380
has already happened in the Capital.

29:13.340 --> 29:14.580
But for me,

29:15.740 --> 29:16.860
nothing matters more

29:17.740 --> 29:19.580
than this Scroll of Longevity

29:19.580 --> 29:21.060
for my father.

29:39.740 --> 29:41.100
It's finally done.

29:42.220 --> 29:44.100
I should go visit Mr. Deng.

29:54.540 --> 29:55.540
How's Xun doing?

29:56.340 --> 29:57.340
Very well.

29:57.580 --> 29:58.740
He's been patient.

29:59.300 --> 30:00.020
He has sent

30:00.060 --> 30:01.300
your birthday gift

30:01.340 --> 30:02.300
to the Imperial Manufactories.

30:02.740 --> 30:03.940
It will be delivered here

30:04.020 --> 30:04.780
with official gifts.

30:05.020 --> 30:05.620
I had intended

30:05.660 --> 30:06.940
to keep the official gifts

30:07.020 --> 30:08.020
outside my prefecture.

30:09.020 --> 30:10.580
Since Xun's gift is among them,

30:12.020 --> 30:13.740
get all those gifts in, then.

30:15.500 --> 30:16.580
Look at this.

30:19.900 --> 30:22.160
[Wangcheng fell at midnight last night, the enmy will soon besiege Yunzhong.]

30:22.780 --> 30:23.860
Wangcheng is lost?

30:25.220 --> 30:25.940
The Northern Desert King

30:25.940 --> 30:27.620
will threaten the court with that city.

30:27.940 --> 30:28.660
For the sake

30:28.660 --> 30:29.740
of thousands of civilians,

30:30.100 --> 30:32.100
the court will have to accept peace talks.

30:33.060 --> 30:34.300
But under such circumstances,

30:34.780 --> 30:36.220
if you send troops against the court,

30:36.980 --> 30:38.220
things might backfire.

30:38.780 --> 30:40.620
Threatening with Wangcheng,

30:40.900 --> 30:41.500
those foes

30:41.500 --> 30:42.780
will get what they want.

30:43.660 --> 30:45.660
They'll also end the war decently.

30:46.500 --> 30:47.580
For them,

30:47.740 --> 30:49.140
that will be a victory.

30:50.260 --> 30:51.820
As for the young emperor,

30:52.060 --> 30:54.740
Chu Zhao, Deng Yi, and Xie Yanfang,

30:56.580 --> 30:58.100
they will lose people's support

30:58.100 --> 30:59.380
as well as their prestige.

30:59.540 --> 31:00.380
By then...

31:00.580 --> 31:02.060
Your prestige will rise greatly.

31:02.500 --> 31:03.380
When you call to arms,

31:03.780 --> 31:05.860
the world will be yours.

31:08.700 --> 31:11.680
[Wangcheng, the north gate]

31:19.300 --> 31:20.980
[Wangcheng]

31:26.580 --> 31:27.260
Help them!

31:28.100 --> 31:29.420
Go. Let's help them!

31:31.180 --> 31:32.900
[Wangcheng]

31:36.340 --> 31:36.940
Stop.

31:37.460 --> 31:38.740
See how many people here

31:38.740 --> 31:39.940
will have to die for you!

31:40.540 --> 31:41.700
General, what do we do?

31:42.780 --> 31:43.340
Bring it on!

31:46.560 --> 31:47.080
Retreat.

31:47.720 --> 31:48.240
General!

31:48.320 --> 31:49.040
I said, retreat!

31:50.900 --> 31:52.300
Losers!

31:52.800 --> 31:53.540
Bring it on!

32:00.740 --> 32:01.140
General,

32:01.660 --> 32:02.580
General Zhong is awake.

32:02.940 --> 32:04.340
According to the Army Physician,

32:04.460 --> 32:05.260
he will survive.

32:05.520 --> 32:06.360
Won't you see him?

32:10.740 --> 32:11.580
Glad he won't die.

32:12.940 --> 32:13.800
What about the mission

32:13.800 --> 32:14.360
I gave you?

32:14.840 --> 32:15.920
Thirty-six soldiers skilled

32:16.080 --> 32:16.480
in disguise

32:16.840 --> 32:17.840
and assassination,

32:17.840 --> 32:18.520
and familiar

32:18.520 --> 32:19.360
with the enemy's capital

32:19.600 --> 32:20.480
are in position.

32:21.260 --> 32:22.260
As you commend,

32:22.560 --> 32:23.960
all has been kept confidential.

32:25.020 --> 32:25.660
Very good.

32:31.120 --> 32:31.680
Move out.

32:45.500 --> 32:46.940
Wangcheng is strategically vital.

32:48.360 --> 32:49.200
Thousands of civilians

32:49.200 --> 32:50.280
are in the hands of enemies.

32:51.360 --> 32:52.680
But Yanlai stays within the camp.

32:54.120 --> 32:55.360
No wonder ministers complain.

32:58.260 --> 32:58.940
A general in war

32:59.600 --> 33:00.640
isn't bound by imperial orders.

33:02.120 --> 33:02.640
I trust him.

33:03.420 --> 33:04.740
I trust him too.

33:07.460 --> 33:08.340
So, when the ministers

33:08.360 --> 33:09.320
wanted to replace him,

33:09.980 --> 33:10.780
I didn't approve.

33:11.660 --> 33:13.180
But to be honest,

33:14.020 --> 33:15.140
I'm a little worried.

33:15.760 --> 33:16.320
Will he

33:16.320 --> 33:17.520
be reckless at this juncture?

33:25.420 --> 33:26.260
Did he really go

33:27.940 --> 33:29.340
to kill the Northern Desert King?

33:33.760 --> 33:34.920
Under such circumstances,

33:35.220 --> 33:35.760
even if Yanlai

33:35.760 --> 33:36.960
manages to kill the King,

33:38.080 --> 33:38.960
the Eldest Prince

33:38.980 --> 33:40.020
will ascend the throne.

33:42.740 --> 33:44.180
He's fierce and warlike,

33:44.740 --> 33:46.340
but not as far-sighted as his father.

33:47.180 --> 33:48.060
By then,

33:48.600 --> 33:49.320
he will invade

33:49.320 --> 33:50.640
in the name of revenge.

33:50.900 --> 33:52.620
His army's morale will soar.

33:53.940 --> 33:55.500
I'm afraid peace talks will be hard.

33:56.500 --> 33:57.620
Is there really no solution

33:58.840 --> 34:00.120
to Wangcheng's problem?

34:07.040 --> 34:08.360
In that case,

34:10.520 --> 34:12.240
I'll have to go to Yunzhong again.

34:12.740 --> 34:13.220
No.

34:25.460 --> 34:26.100
When I go,

34:26.700 --> 34:27.980
I can at least steady the troops.

34:29.220 --> 34:30.220
I'll go instead.

34:34.320 --> 34:35.680
There's something ministers can do,

34:36.980 --> 34:38.220
but a princess can't.

34:39.600 --> 34:40.080
You...

34:40.260 --> 34:41.020
Rest assured.

34:41.760 --> 34:43.000
I will not accept

34:43.000 --> 34:44.040
any of their conditions.

34:45.280 --> 34:46.560
Yu is my hope.

34:47.660 --> 34:48.900
I place great hopes on him

34:48.920 --> 34:50.240
and intend to support him.

34:51.440 --> 34:52.600
When he was little,

34:52.960 --> 34:54.800
he witnessed his parents' brutal death.

34:56.560 --> 34:57.920
He barely survived

34:58.040 --> 34:59.040
and took the throne.

34:59.800 --> 35:01.120
Then rebellion and invasion came.

35:01.840 --> 35:02.640
If he couldn't be

35:02.680 --> 35:03.800
a wise emperor

35:04.800 --> 35:05.760
who expanded his state

35:06.320 --> 35:07.200
and achieved something

35:07.200 --> 35:08.160
beyond his forebears,

35:10.640 --> 35:12.520
it would be unfair to what he suffered.

35:16.640 --> 35:18.400
And accepting peace talks

35:20.080 --> 35:20.880
is a humiliation

35:22.120 --> 35:23.360
to someone like me.

35:23.680 --> 35:25.120
Then, what are you going to do?

35:26.160 --> 35:26.760
Will you trade

35:26.760 --> 35:27.920
the people in Wangcheng

35:28.560 --> 35:29.480
for victory?

35:33.040 --> 35:34.400
How could you think of me that way?

35:41.840 --> 35:43.400
You broke my heart.

35:45.160 --> 35:46.000
Rejecting peace talks

35:46.960 --> 35:48.120
is your idea.

35:48.960 --> 35:49.640
Your reputation

35:49.680 --> 35:50.760
is Yu's reputation.

35:51.800 --> 35:52.680
How could I ever

35:52.680 --> 35:53.800
abandon people in Wangcheng?

35:54.880 --> 35:56.560
It's all right that you don't trust me.

35:58.200 --> 36:00.920
You should have faith in what I can do.

36:06.200 --> 36:06.720
That's right.

36:09.200 --> 36:10.760
I have faith in what you can do.

36:33.480 --> 36:34.360
From tomorrow on,

36:36.000 --> 36:37.160
kill a hundred civilians

36:37.560 --> 36:38.840
on the rampart every day

36:39.680 --> 36:41.600
until the State of Chu accepts

36:41.600 --> 36:42.360
all our conditions.

36:43.000 --> 36:43.680
Yes.

36:45.160 --> 36:46.040
Your Majesty!

36:46.400 --> 36:47.480
Your Majesty!

36:52.320 --> 36:53.200
Aren't you a follower

36:53.200 --> 36:54.160
of the Eldest Prince?

36:55.040 --> 36:55.880
Why are you here

36:56.760 --> 36:57.640
instead of in our capital?

36:58.080 --> 36:58.960
The Eldest Prince...

36:59.840 --> 37:01.280
He was killed.

37:01.760 --> 37:02.720
What did you say?

37:12.960 --> 37:14.840
It's something my son always keeps.

37:15.200 --> 37:16.080
Some enemy soldiers

37:16.440 --> 37:17.560
invaded our capital

37:17.720 --> 37:18.720
and killed His Highness.

37:19.240 --> 37:20.320
Before His Highness died,

37:20.680 --> 37:22.120
he gave this to me.

37:22.360 --> 37:23.880
I fought my way out

37:24.120 --> 37:25.200
to bring you this news!

37:25.560 --> 37:27.160
You must avenge His Highness!

37:28.760 --> 37:30.120
How dare you curse my son!

37:31.920 --> 37:32.560
Son.

37:33.280 --> 37:33.920
My son.

37:34.280 --> 37:34.960
My son!

37:36.680 --> 37:38.520
[Wangcheng]

37:38.880 --> 37:39.520
Your Majesty.

37:40.920 --> 37:41.520
Oh my son.

37:55.960 --> 37:57.020
When Mr. Xie goes,

37:57.140 --> 37:58.300
he will succeed.

37:58.920 --> 38:00.240
We must teach those foes

38:00.360 --> 38:01.200
a good lesson!

38:01.400 --> 38:02.760
- Yes. - That's right.

38:03.920 --> 38:04.760
Give them a lesson.

38:04.800 --> 38:06.160
- Yes. - Show them what we can do.

38:06.480 --> 38:07.520
Mr. Xie, we'll entrust you

38:08.640 --> 38:09.840
with frontier affairs.

38:11.120 --> 38:12.680
His Majesty and I believe

38:13.320 --> 38:14.000
you will

38:14.680 --> 38:16.600
protect our people

38:17.560 --> 38:19.040
and safeguard our state's dignity.

38:19.200 --> 38:19.680
I will not

38:20.320 --> 38:21.320
fail my mission.

38:28.640 --> 38:29.520
Great news!

38:31.640 --> 38:32.640
Great news!

38:33.560 --> 38:34.040
Oh no.

38:34.280 --> 38:34.960
Great victory!

38:35.280 --> 38:36.200
Great victory!

38:42.000 --> 38:43.600
Guard General Xie Yanlai

38:44.080 --> 38:45.560
has killed the Eldest Prince of Northern Desert,

38:46.000 --> 38:47.200
broken into the King's camp,

38:47.600 --> 38:48.200
and caught...

38:49.200 --> 38:50.360
Caught the King alive!

39:11.720 --> 39:13.520
My son!

39:17.120 --> 39:19.840
♪Trapped in this tiny world♪

39:19.880 --> 39:20.760
Terrific!

39:22.080 --> 39:23.360
He caught the King alive.

39:24.360 --> 39:28.520
♪I meddle around without any mercy♪

39:29.020 --> 39:31.520
♪I'm my own pawn♪

39:32.060 --> 39:34.840
♪I sigh at my fate♪

39:35.080 --> 39:36.080
Great.

39:38.560 --> 39:39.240
Yes.

39:40.480 --> 39:41.320
This is great.

39:43.980 --> 39:46.800
♪Traps within traps, I never make mistakes♪

39:46.800 --> 39:50.100
♪I take a risk at every step♪

39:50.100 --> 39:52.100
♪The world is my Weiqi game board♪

39:52.900 --> 39:56.440
♪I hold the reins♪

39:59.480 --> 40:04.080
♪Broken walls and withered branches, trapped in the mire♪

40:04.360 --> 40:06.840
♪Yet still striving to reach for the sky♪

40:06.880 --> 40:10.920
